      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/983d8a543fae2c8a0cb406354fceb85a/31c7724170980203-99/s640x960/6ce308f89527155f9374441834c8f3fb55138c39.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"667\" data-orig-width=\"1000\" alt=\"Image: A graph with lots of red dots clustered together in a curve. The are all looking upwards at a single red dot wearing sunglasses. &#10;&#10;Caption: Mike was an outlier and would probably be excluded from the study, but all the other data points secretly thought he was really cool.\" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/983d8a543fae2c8a0cb406354fceb85a/31c7724170980203-99/s75x75_c1/746fbfe83b20c15236758c254c241fb7c3590b2a.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/983d8a543fae2c8a0cb406354fceb85a/31c7724170980203-99/s100x200/80dab39793799116e041fd01e78e064173b48c55.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/983d8a543fae2c8a0cb406354fceb85a/31c7724170980203-99/s250x400/95e568a34f4e9eb8b00b36610cc16e66dd589642.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/983d8a543fae2c8a0cb406354fceb85a/31c7724170980203-99/s400x600/4689ef977f8e52e9fc7c8985715e86d389572a38.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/983d8a543fae2c8a0cb406354fceb85a/31c7724170980203-99/s500x750/9c08326a6ef0825455562021fec6a81924323146.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/983d8a543fae2c8a0cb406354fceb85a/31c7724170980203-99/s540x810/1f303a9b738c6304ae165107e353aa4775f595d5.jpg 540w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/983d8a543fae2c8a0cb406354fceb85a/31c7724170980203-99/s640x960/6ce308f89527155f9374441834c8f3fb55138c39.jpg 640w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/983d8a543fae2c8a0cb406354fceb85a/31c7724170980203-99/s1280x1920/b234233b0c45cdf413ff82634722dc7805b57481.jpg 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\"/>"
