      "title": "My latest books cartoon for the Guardian ",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/e375607392ee08157c71ea32656c82eb/b6c23eedb954390a-73/s640x960/55ac270baf92eb51364354bc52056f03b0aa86be.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"821\" data-orig-width=\"1500\" alt=\"Title: Gentlemen! Are you in want of a wife? Allow our algorithm to assist!  Image: a series of yes/no questions for that lead to different outcomes.   Questions include &#xE2;&#x80;&#x9C;are you rich?&#xE2;&#x80;&#x9D;, &#xE2;&#x80;&#x9C;are you dashing?&#xE2;&#x80;&#x9D;, &#xE2;&#x80;&#x9C;are you a rake&#xE2;&#x80;&#x9D; and &#xE2;&#x80;&#x9C;are you a vicar?&#xE2;&#x80;&#x9D;  Outcomes include &#xE2;&#x80;&#x9C;You win the most beautiful daughter of the richest man in the county!&#xE2;&#x80;&#x9D;, &#xE2;&#x80;&#x9C;You remain a bachelor&#xE2;&#x80;&#x9D;, &#xE2;&#x80;&#x9C;You marry a dowdy cousin&#xE2;&#x80;&#x9D; and &#xE2;&#x80;&#x9C;You rescue a 23-year-old from Spinsterhood&#xE2;&#x80;&#x9D;.\" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/e375607392ee08157c71ea32656c82eb/b6c23eedb954390a-73/s75x75_c1/62db96a58730ee6801bb941a5ae0657d092e860a.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/e375607392ee08157c71ea32656c82eb/b6c23eedb954390a-73/s100x200/e40c0a3e2b4ea19cd7de417f3f90c53b3e0916f9.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/e375607392ee08157c71ea32656c82eb/b6c23eedb954390a-73/s250x400/e2ed7444f53c47be139b1162cef52f625d2c4abf.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/e375607392ee08157c71ea32656c82eb/b6c23eedb954390a-73/s400x600/b45134c6f8c187964c333b2badce5ef7e28ac019.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/e375607392ee08157c71ea32656c82eb/b6c23eedb954390a-73/s500x750/37fb357c694de9caddd6bf592b255697b4ade7f9.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/e375607392ee08157c71ea32656c82eb/b6c23eedb954390a-73/s540x810/dc49521f92ef80a1d623011f336b89cd9ff3013a.jpg 540w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/e375607392ee08157c71ea32656c82eb/b6c23eedb954390a-73/s640x960/55ac270baf92eb51364354bc52056f03b0aa86be.jpg 640w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/e375607392ee08157c71ea32656c82eb/b6