    {
      "id": "https://myjetpack.tumblr.com/post/827833794333638656",
      "url": "https://myjetpack.tumblr.com/post/827833794333638656",
      "title": "My latest New Scientist cartoon",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/cdfaf194c0e0eb79b0e71c85f3c32101/f9ef4080701bab30-af/s640x960/1a363944afd4de08aaeaf0036b4ab004a200e660.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"1010\" data-orig-width=\"1500\" alt=\"Course: Introduction to Basic Philosophical Astronomy &#10;Type: Six-week evening class &#10;Location: Physics Building Roof &#10;&#10;Modules: &#10;Week One - Whoa, look at all those stars &#10;Week Two - Dude, there are, like, bajillions &#10;Week Three - let me blow your mind with some big bang facts &#10;week Four - d'you think aliens are doing this on their planet?&#10;Week Five - Let's just chill out and take it all in for a while &#10;Week Six - Seriously, it's crazy how many stars are up there &#10;&#10;Image: figures sprawl on the roof of a building, gazing at a sky filled with stars.\" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/cdfaf194c0e0eb79b0e71c85f3c32101/f9ef4080701bab30-af/s75x75_c1/24ca4345034c6d1a09105594ef340a5827a4b4d2.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cdfaf194c0e0eb79b0e71c85f3c32101/f9ef4080701bab30-af/s100x200/402cf9d668988d90fecaeba5c2721cb84d516786.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cdfaf194c0e0eb79b0e71c85f3c32101/f9ef4080701bab30-af/s250x400/e1e6c7a1338217a3f7370168c3c990d6659b6f3c.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cdfaf194c0e0eb79b0e71c85f3c32101/f9ef4080701bab30-af/s400x600/037faad040242bb98d64ca2708518267b4c0b2f4.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cdfaf194c0e0eb79b0e71c85f3c32101/f9ef4080701bab30-af/s500x750/30d367300757e12fa1eb6db303bdd31336dd07fb.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cdfaf194c0e0eb79b0e71c85f3c32101/f9ef4080701bab30-af/s540x810/e6a8c3978e96b37da3be8b091a1859888854afc2.jpg 540w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cdfaf194c0e0eb79b0e71c85f3c32101/f9ef4080701bab30-af/s640x960/1a363944afd4de08aaeaf0036b4ab004a200e660.jpg 640w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cdfaf194c0e0eb79b0e71c85f3c32101/f9ef4080701bab30-af/s1280x1920/46ec1738aa3de033cdad769a73f9986d584ad68e.jpg 1280w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/c